                <invention-title lang="de">KONSOLENBASIERTES CHIRURGISCHES SYSTEM MIT KONFIGURATION ZUR ANZEIGE DER ABBILDUNG VON SYSTEMKOMPONENTEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME CHIRURGICAL BASÉ SUR UNE CONSOLE CONFIGURÉ POUR INDIQUER LA MISE EN CORRESPONDANCE DE COMPOSANTS DE SYSTÈME</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CONSOLE-BASED SURGICAL SYSTEM CONFIGURED TO INDICATE MAPPING OF SYSTEM COMPONENTS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A console-based surgical system comprises a plurality of handheld surgical instruments, a footswitch and a console. Each of said instruments comprises an instrument visual indicator. The footswitch comprises a footswitch visual indicator, and the console is connectable to said plurality of surgical instruments and said footswitch. The console comprises a controller configured to associate said footswitch with one instrument of said plurality handheld surgical instruments such that said footswitch is operable to actuate a function of said associated instrument. Said footswitch visual indicator of said footswitch and said instrument visual indicator of said associated instrument are activated to display outputs that correspond with one another.</p>
            </abstract>
